<title>ESTONIA: CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 16/17.</title>
<headline>CENTRAL BANK FIXINGS FOR APRIL 16/17.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Estonian central bank</p>
<p>released the following fixings for the Estonian kroon for April</p>
<p>16/17. The Estonian kroon is pegged at eight kroons to a German</p>
<p>mark.</p>
<p>	    April 16/17   April 15/16</p>
<p> CZK	0.4559	  0.45011</p>
<p> DKK	2.10081	 2.099</p>
<p> FIM	2.66589	 2.67621</p>
<p> HUF	0.07634	 0.07637</p>
<p> JPY	0.1095	  0.10963</p>
<p> LTL	3.44986	 3.45986</p>
<p> LVL     23.73505	23.65533</p>
<p> RUR	0.0024	  0.00241</p>
<p> SEK	1.78991	 1.79916</p>
<p> UAH	7.47244	 7.48539</p>
<p> USD     13.796	  13.836</p>
<p> XEU     15.63639	15.63676</p>
<p>For a full listing see Bank of Estonia </p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 630 8400 reuters@reuters.ee</p>
